&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fingerprint&lt;/strong&gt; empowers enterprises to detect and stop online fraud with the world’s most accurate device intelligence.&amp;nbsp; We lead our industry with bleeding-edge identification capabilities and work on turning new ideas and discoveries in the fraud detection space into reality. Our customers range from innovative startups to leading enterprise companies, including Plaid, Dropbox, and Booking.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fingerprint is a globally dispersed, 100% remote company.&lt;/strong&gt; We were named on on the 2026 Forbes Best Startup Employers list and ranked #803 on the 2026 Inc. 5000 list of America’s fastest-growing private companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/fingerprintjs&quot;&gt;We have raised $77M &lt;/a&gt;and are backed by Craft Ventures (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tesla.com/&quot;&gt;Tesla, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://facebook.com/&quot;&gt;Facebook, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Airbnb &lt;/a&gt;), Nexus Venture Partners ( &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.postman.com/&quot;&gt;Postman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.apollo.io/&quot;&gt;Apollo.io,&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://min.io/&quot;&gt;MinIO&lt;/a&gt;, Druva) and Uncorrelated Ventures ( &lt;a href=&quot;https://redis.io/&quot;&gt;Redis, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://rollbar.com/&quot;&gt;Rollbar, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gradle.org/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Gradle&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location Preference: Remote, Anywhere in the US/North America preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to build and own a function from the ground up in a fast growing startup. We&#39;re bringing brand, content, and design together under one leader for the first time - and we&#39;re looking for someone to shape what that function becomes, how it operates, and the bar it sets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But this isn&#39;t brand for brand&#39;s sake. At Fingerprint, brand exists to &lt;strong&gt;drive pipeline and generate demand&lt;/strong&gt;—and to build the awareness that makes demand easier to win. You&#39;ll own how we show up in the world &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; how that translates into revenue results. Reporting to the VP of Marketing and joining the marketing leadership team, you&#39;ll set brand and creative strategy, lead the teams that bring it to life, and treat pipeline as the scoreboard, not an afterthought.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want someone who pushes - who challenges the team to try things we haven&#39;t tried, takes big swings, and isn&#39;t precious about which ideas win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ethos is &lt;strong&gt;Fail. Learn. Grow.&lt;/strong&gt; We take big bets, fail fast, and judge ideas on their merit - not on who they came from or what title proposed them. We want this leader to &lt;em&gt;embody&lt;/em&gt; that spirit and:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a portfolio of bets, not a list of safe deliverables—some swings should be ambitious enough to fail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move fast, measure honestly, and kill or double down based on evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the conditions for the best idea to win regardless of seniority - including ideas that aren&#39;t yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat every miss as fuel for the next attempt, and build a team culture that does the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a new, unified Brand &amp;amp; Creative function - defining its mandate, operating model, and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own brand and creative strategy in direct service of &lt;strong&gt;pipeline and demand&lt;/strong&gt;, alongside brand awareness and reputation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and raise the strategic altitude of a multidisciplinary team across content, social/brand, and design - holding them accountable for both outcomes and their development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and set the editorial calendar, and direct creative across the funnel - so content and creative ship on a deliberate cadence that&#39;s measurably moving the business, not just looking good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide the team with a stream of creative concepts to experiment with, feeding the demand generation testing cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own brand and creative standards, voice, and tone across and collaborate with channel leads to implement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Demand Generation and Product Marketing to identify and close content gaps for target-account needs, ensuring brand and creative support demand programs rather than run parallel to them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how brand and creative impact is measured - tying work to pipeline, demand, and awareness—and report on it candidly, wins and misses alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent brand and creative in marketing leadership forums and shape company-wide go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in brand, design, or creative direction, including 3+ years building and leading creative teams - ideally in B2B SaaS or an agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio spanning both system-level brand work (identity, guidelines, messaging frameworks) and high-craft execution across web, content, social, and campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of brand and creative work that moved business metrics - pipeline, demand, and awareness - not just creative output, and the data to demonstrate it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate business goals into clear creative briefs, concepts, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading multidisciplinary teams across design, content, and social as a player-coach - equally credible setting direction and getting hands-on. Comfortably acts as a connector across departments, and the kind of partner whose commitments and timelines other teams trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of building and scaling brand systems and creative processes - guidelines, templates, and workflows - that let a lean team punch above its weight and keep non-designers on-brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems-minded operator who builds frameworks that outlast you, leads calmly under pressure, and creates clarity in ambiguity, rather than someone whose impact is capped by their own output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, visual, and verbal communication - you can present creative rationale to an executive audience and earn buy-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset: you partner with the Director of demand generation to define how brand and creative impact is measured and report on it candidly, wins and misses alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort partnering across demand generation, product marketing, and corporate communications to ship one coherent story across the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role requires proficiency with macOS and comfort working fully remotely using tools such as Slack, Google Workspace, Zoom Webinar, and Asana&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Transparency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fingerprint, we believe in pay transparency — it&#39;s part of how we operate as a distributed, remote-first team.&amp;nbsp; Salaries are based on function, level, and geographic location, benchmarked against similar stage growth companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because this role is open across the United States and can be based anywhere our team members work from, the salary range reflects that geographic breadth: $166,000 - $225,000.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some example salaries for specific locations are below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New York City: $196,000 - $225,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chicago: $166,000 - $191,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors, including the successful candidate&#39;s location, experience, and expertise, and may vary from the amounts listed above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Due to regulatory and security reasons, there’s a small number of countries where we cannot have Fingerprint teammates based. Additionally, because Fingerprint is an all-remote company and people can join our workforce from almost any country, we do not sponsor visas. Fingerprint teammates need to be authorized to work from their home location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are dedicated to creating an inclusive work environment for everyone. We embrace and celebrate the unique experiences, perspectives and cultural backgrounds that each employee brings to our workplace. Fingerprint strives to foster an environment where our employees feel respected, valued and empowered, and our team members are at the forefront in helping us promote and sustain an inclusive workplace. We highly encourage people from underrepresented groups in tech to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are applying as a resident of California, please read our CCPA notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://dev.fingerprint.com/docs/dpa-ccpa&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are applying as a resident of the EU, please read our GDPR notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://dev.fingerprint.com/docs/dpa-gdpr&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;**We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Fingerprint recruiting email communications will always come from the @fingerprint.com domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Fingerprint via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
